   "title": "5-amino-1MQ",
   "subtitle": "5-amino-1MQ",
   "description": "5-amino-1MQ (5-amino-1-methylquinolinium) is a small-molecule quinolinium salt, not a peptide. PubChem CID 950107 (the cation); formula C10H11N2+; molecular weight 159.21 g/mol for the cation. It is used in enzyme and cell assays as an inhibitor of nicotinamide N-methyltransferase (NNMT). Research areas: NNMT enzymology, NAD+ and methylation metabolism in cell models. Supplied as a lyophilized powder for laboratory research use only. Not for human or veterinary use.",
